/// this flag can significantly increase the cost and should typically only be enabled for debug mode.
///
/// \param enableDiagnosticMode Enables diagnostic mode which writes all SDK logs to a file. The log file can be attached when reporting a bug to help with debugging SDK issues. Defaults to <code>false</code>.
///
/// \param enableDiagnosticModeGesture Enable double finger double tap gesture to export SDK logs via share sheet. This
/// functionality is only available if <code>enableDiagnosticMode</code> is set to <code>true</code>. Defaults to <code>false</code>.
///
